---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="MastersVault has no accounts and keeps your data in your browser.">
  <div class="container page prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} is a static website hosted on GitHub Pages. It has no accounts, no sign-in, no advertising and no
      analytics or tracking scripts.
    </p>

    <h2>What's stored, and where</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Your test attempts and progress</strong> are saved in your browser's local storage on this device.
        They are never sent to us or anyone else.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Your colour-theme choice</strong> is saved the same way.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Clearing your browser's site data deletes this information. On the dashboard you can export it to a file, import
      it on another device, or delete it all at once.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      Like any web host, GitHub may log basic request information such as IP addresses when pages are served. See
      GitHub's privacy statement for details. {SITE.name} has no access to those logs.
    </p>

    <h2>Fonts and third parties</h2>
    <p>
      The site loads no third-party fonts, scripts or embeds. Everything is served from the same origin.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
